```console
$ scherzo-cloud connection linear delete --help
Delete a Linear connection and release its workspace

Usage: scherzo-cloud connection linear delete [OPTIONS] --yes <ORGANIZATION> <CONNECTION>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <CONNECTION>    Exact Linear connection ID

Options:
      --json                           Emit newline-delimited JSON events
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
      --yes                            Confirm removal of the Linear connection credential or workspace binding
  -h, --help                           Print help

```
